Here is a concise report based on **read-only** inspection of `C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports`, in your requested priority order.

---

## 1. Concrete bet ladder values

**Strongest evidence: screenshots (PNG)** — partial ladder visible on the main/info chrome:

| Evidence file | What it shows |
|----------------|----------------|
| `C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports/Screenshot 2026-04-28 145634.png` | Bottom bar shows five selectable totals **0.80, 1.00, 1.60 (highlighted), 2.00, 3.00**, plus **− / +** for adjacent steps; label **BET 1.60**. |

**PDF (rules text only — no numeric ladder):**

| Evidence file | Snippet |
|----------------|---------|
| `C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports/Play Moon Princess 100 online _ Casino games _ Shokker.pdf` | *“Click any of the **five bet buttons** to select a bet or use the plus and minus buttons to increase or decrease the bet **by one step**.”* (structure matches UI; **does not list EUR amounts**.) |

**Moon Princess JS/CSS:** No extracted **numeric bet ladder array** was found in readable form — `moonprincess100_mobile.bundle.js` is a single heavily minified line and did not surface discrete tier lists via search; bet-related CSS is mostly layout/selectors (e.g. `#betview_fixedbet`, quick-menu bet info), not amounts.

---

## 2. Payout per symbol — rules / tables

### A. Official rules text (PDF)

`Play Moon Princess 100 online _ Casino games _ Shokker.pdf` includes:

- Cluster/adjacency framing, **only highest win per winning symbol combination**, **same bet** in features unless stated, **94.20% RTP**, **grid clear prize 50 × total bet × active win multiplier** (matches in-game help screenshots).

Example snippets (line refs from extracted text):

```41:43:C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports/Play Moon Princess 100 online _ Casino games _ Shokker.pdf
Completely clearing the grid of symbols (except during the Trinity feature) awards an instant prize. The prize awarded is 50x the total bet
multiplied by the active win multiplier at the time of clearing the grid.
The average RTP is 94.20%. RTP is achieved through participation.
```

```15:17:C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports/Play Moon Princess 100 online _ Casino games _ Shokker.pdf
Moon Princess 100 is a video slot game played on a 5x5 grid. Symbols drop down in the grid to form winning combinations. Wins are
achieved by getting 3 or more symbols in a row, horizontally or vertically. All rows and columns are active, and symbols can be part of
multiple winning combinations.
```

### B. Numeric paytables (screenshots — **currency amounts at one UI state**)

These PNGs are the **only place in `exports`** where **per-symbol cash amounts** appear clearly; they are consistent with **total bet 1.60** on the same session (e.g. first screenshot shows BET 1.60).

| File | Content |
|------|---------|
| `.../Screenshot 2026-04-28 145838.png` | **PRINCESSES:** Love / Star / Storm — **X5 16.00, X4 1.60, X3 0.48** each; **Any mix** — **X5 8.00, X4 0.80, X3 0.32**. Footer: max win **15000× bet**; wins need **3+ in a row H/V**; cascades; multiplier rises each drop. |
| `.../Screenshot 2026-04-28 145844.png` | **SYMBOLS (lower tiers):** Bell & Heart — **X5 4.80, X4 0.48, X3 0.24**; Star & green moon icon — **X5 3.20, X4 0.32, X3 0.16**. Same footer rules as above. |
| `.../Screenshot 2026-04-28 145829.png` | **WILD:** **X5 80.00, X4 3.20, X3 1.60**; substitutes all; wilds removed when no other symbols remain. |

### C. Feature-related payouts / multipliers (screenshots + PDF)

| File | Rule |
|------|------|
| `Screenshot 2026-04-28 145815.png` | Clear grid (outside Trinity): **50 × total bet**, scaled by **active win multiplier**. |
| `Screenshot 2026-04-28 145742.png` | Free spins: multiplier **up to ×100**; meter grants **extra spins up to 100**. |
| PDF | Meter fill from princess wins: **X5 → 3 sections, X4 → 2, X3 → 1**; Trinity / FS spin counts (Love/Star/Storm), etc. |

### D. CSS structure (no numeric tables — layout/class names only)

`paytable.css` / `mobile_videoslot.css` define **wild / princess / HP / LP** sprite hooks and **X3/X4/X5** label/value slots (e.g. `.fiveValue`, `.threeValue`), but **not** the numeric payout data:

```353:392:C:/Users/valtt/OneDrive/Godot/AXEL/axel_project/exports/moon_princess_files/paytable.css
